  <item>
    <title>6.日记本系列：综艺配奥运的幸福暑假！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a0e4f97349f7a5573e23af</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a0e4f97349f7a5573e23af</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 26 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>wal日记本主题曲：我要的幸福 (live)-YELLOW黄宣</span></p><span></span><p><span>消失三周，主播带着一大堆综艺重磅回归！一看一个不吱声！</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目还包括主播第一次染发经历 追星过程 购物分享 暑期计划...</span></p><span></span><p><span>奥运在即，希望我爱的所有运动员们都可以健健康康 圆梦巴黎！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show notes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="71">01:11</a>暑假一回家就狂补综艺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> 歌手2024（心梗版）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> 许钧！！都去听期待集吧！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">03:35</a> yellow黄宣！！十全十美的幸福！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="605">10:05</a> tia袁娅维！！女王上海见！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="948">15:48</a> 五十公里桃花坞4</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="968">16:08</a> 仁科 掌管世界的神！！（修铁路第一人 给朋友准备专属的音乐会 蟑螂的神…）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1104">18:24</a> 脱口秀的朋友们！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1119">18:39</a> 你会选择轨道还是狂野？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1221">20:21</a> 爸爸当家3 康熙来了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1372">22:52</a> NewJeans我入坑了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1473">24:33</a> 人生第一次染发！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1653">27:33</a> 购买窗帘 罗马帘心得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">30:10</a> 暑假上课的阴间作息…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1908">31:48</a> 超大吸管水杯！！上链接！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2011">33:31</a> 莎莎大头！！巴黎圆梦！！（本期节目更新的动力）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2259">37:39</a> 一个小学的同学要去奥运了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a> 接下来的规划（戏剧 音乐 旅游 上课 练琴…）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2448">40:48</a> 彩蛋在结尾 黄宣无代餐！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bgm：</span></p><span></span><p><span>飛騨探訪-RADWIMPS</span></p><span></span><p><span>一天-YELLOW黄宣</span></p><span></span><p><span>夜来香Flow Like A Flower (live)-袁娅维TIA RAY</span></p><span></span><p><span>我要的幸福 (live)-YELLOW黄宣</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于【What's a Life】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜网易云音乐｜QQ音乐｜Apple Podcast&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>都可以收听</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信：Rena999999wal</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：Whats a Life</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：播客whats_a_Life</span></p><span></span><p><span>每周五8.am准时更新 欢迎您来！！</span></p>]]></description>
