    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>WAL期推：Small girl(feat.D.O.)-LEE YOUNG JI</span></p><span></span><p><span>放暑假啦！！难免会回想起那些关于小时候暑假的趣事！！今天的节目把大家带进rere（给自己去的很作的小名 别管）家的餐桌上 体会一下 咱家的家规吧！！听完节目的你也可以当奶奶的兵了！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝正在听节目的你不论有没有暑假 都可以让自己放松一会儿 开心一会儿！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show notes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="29">00:29</a> 主播状态大回春！！放暑假啦！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 节目增加新设备 话筒一枚！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> 乐极生悲 录制节目小插曲…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="181">03:01</a> 练乐器的朋友都知道暑假意味着什么…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="273">04:33</a> 餐桌上的隐性家规</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="314">05:14</a> 重生之我在家里当服务员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="361">06:01</a> 怎么治不爱吃饭的小孩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="435">07:15</a> 坐姿端正和做人一样重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="511">08:31</a> 长这么大我其实还不会用筷子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="627">10:27</a> 勺子的隐藏使用手册</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">13:10</a> 餐桌雷区你不要踩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="824">13:44</a> 吃完饭也要宣告天下hhhh</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="851">14:11</a> 抽签洗碗才是一顿饭的结束</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bgm：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Small girl(feat.D.O.)-LEE YOUNG JI</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于【What's a Life】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜网易云音乐｜QQ音乐｜Apple Podcast</span></p><span></span><p><span>都可以收听</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信：Rena999999wal</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：Whats a Life</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：播客whats_a_Life</span></p><span></span><p><span>每周五8.am准时更新 欢迎您来！！</span></p>]]></description>
