    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>wal日记本主题曲：没有理想的人不伤心-新裤子乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span>过山车的生活下，能产出一期节目，我就要表扬自己，我很棒！</span></p><span></span><p><span>很有姜思达风格的一期节目（别管 就是硬蹭）</span></p><span></span><p><span>既然要蹭 那就蹭到底 听吧 没有别的话了...</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show notes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> 打脸时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 崩溃周五</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="434">07:14</a> 崩溃周六</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> 崩溃周日</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="697">11:37</a> 成功变态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="725">12:05</a> 开麦吐槽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="818">13:38</a> 指南法则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 如何逃避</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="896">14:56</a> 电影推荐：宇宙探索编辑部</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a> 综艺推荐：乐夏 奇葩说 一喜二喜（米为打钱）十三邀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="973">16:13</a> 音乐推荐：本期主题曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1021">17:01</a> 播客推荐：无聊斋 宇宙探索编辑部 群英会系列</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1119">18:39</a> 硬要总结</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bgm：</span></p><span></span><p><span>生活倒影-苏运莹</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于【What's a Life】：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜网易云音乐｜QQ音乐｜Apple Podcast&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>都可以收听</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信：Rena999999wal</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：Whats a Life</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：播客whats_a_Life</span></p><span></span><p><span>每周五8.am准时更新 欢迎您来！！</span></p>]]></description>
